Another weapon should be added to the game.
I'm referring to a white cane.
This could either be a rigid model or a folding model.
In both cases this weapon should not appear until or
unless a player becomes blind.
The cane should be able to be used for a weapon as
well as for mobility.  The tapping of the white
cane would of course cancel any stealth intrinsic though and
if in not good standing with your deity might also cause
aggravate monster intrinsic to be gained.
Since white canes didn't exist in times past possibly a staff would be
more appropriate.  Maybe a useful ability for the
staff to have would be when held to point at monsters that aren't
right next to the player relative to the direction the player faces and these
directions might come out a monster is to your northeast.  The pointing function
would only disclose the information on the closest monster though.

Also some braille fortune cookies should be put into the game which
sighted players can't read.  When you become blind you gain the intrinsic
of read braille.  This would redress the fact that
when players become blind seeing eye dogs aren't provided by their
deities.
I used my hackidea alias to send this message.
Any additional ideas or further refinements?

